 ('jacopo','Jacopo Tartan','Fisherman of the Bar','a man painting his door a red that hurts to look at',"“So I know it,” he says. “Jacopo Tartan. My neighbour is yellow. We do not speak.”","Jacopo fishes the open sea and says lagoon fish taste of the city.","“We are the wall,” Jacopo says. “The sea has to get past us first.”",'seaside','lagoonside'),
