 ('zaccaria','Zaccaria Bomb','Sergeant of the Sea-Gate','a stout man greasing a chain link with great tenderness',"“She has not gone up since my grandfather,” he says. “Zaccaria Bomb. She will go up tomorrow if the Doge says.”","Zaccaria drills the garrison every week against a fleet that has never come.","“A chain you never use is the best kind,” Zaccaria says.",'chainroom','rampart'),
