 ('momola','Momola Scorz','Tanner of the Isle','a woman scraping a hide over a beam with a two-handled knife',"“You will stop noticing,” she says. “Momola Scorz. Then you go to the city and they notice for you.”","Momola says the Ten Families all wear her gloves and none would cross to thank her.","“A year in the pit,” Momola says. “Leather cannot be hurried. Neither can I.”",'pits','frames'),
